pires-forge (1.9.0+resilience.8-pires1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebrand: Rayforge -> Pires Forge.
    - Update Source and Package names in debian/control.
    - Display name and AppStream ID changed to org.piresforge.pires-forge.
    - Python binary entry point is now pires-forge (the user runs
      'pires-forge', not 'rayforge').
    - MIME types changed to application/x-piresforge-{project,sketch}.
    - .desktop, .metainfo, and AppStream ID renamed accordingly.
    - Debian package renamed from 'rayforge' to 'pires-forge'.
  * The Python module path 'rayforge/' and addon names 'rayforge-addon-*'
    are KEPT unchanged for upstream and addon-compat.

 -- Yuri Schmaltz <security@yuri-schmaltz.dev>  Sat, 01 Aug 2026 01:02:53 +0000

pires-forge (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Update maintainer to Yuri Schmaltz <security@yuri-schmaltz.dev>
    (fork maintained at github.com/yuri-schmaltz/rayforge).
  * Add python3-defusedxml to Depends: (required by
    rayforge.image.lightburn.importer since PR #14, was
    failing at import time on user installations).

